;PROGRAM NAME: 1001
;GCODE CREATED ON 2026-11-22 AT 08-27-17

;POST: DUET 2 ETHERNET / RRF 2.05.1 CNC (ULTIMATEREPRAPPOST FORK)
;   TARGET: DUET 2 ETHERNET, REPRAPFIRMWARE 2.05.1, CNC MODE (M453)
;TOOLS IN THIS PROGRAM
;   T1 D=6.35 CR=0 - ZMIN=-0.508 - FLAT END MILL

;POST SETTINGS USED
;  RETRACT STRATEGY: FUSION CLEARANCE HEIGHT IN ACTIVE WCS BEFORE XY MOVES
;  SAFE MACHINE Z (G53): 0 (USED)
;  MANUAL TOOL CHANGE: YES, PARK AT G53 X0 Y0
;  TN OUTPUT: NONE, PROBE AFTER TOOL CHANGE: NONE
;  SPINDLE DWELL: PROPORTIONAL, SPINDLE STOP DWELL: 10S
;  HOME ON TOOL CHANGE (G28): NO, END WITH M0: NO
;PREREQUISITES BEFORE PRESSING START
;  1. MACHINE HOMED. 2. FIRMWARE IN CNC MODE (M453). 3. ACTIVE WCS ORIGIN SET FOR THIS SETUP (G10 L20).
;  4. FIRST TOOL MOUNTED AND ITS Z ZERO VALID. 5. SAFE MACHINE Z AND TOOL CHANGE XY CLEAR ALL CLAMPS WITH THE LONGEST TOOL.
;  THE POST DOES NOT KNOW THE MACHINE POSITION AT START. THE FIRST MOTION IS A Z MOVE IN THE CHOSEN RETRACT STRATEGY.

;-+- PROGRAM BEGINS HERE -+-
G90
G21
M300
M291 P"Homed, WCS zeroed, T1 D6.35 mounted? First move is Z retract. OK starts, Cancel aborts" R"Start job" S3

;TITLE-> OPERATION SPOT DRILL 64
